@startuml UC06 - Execute Follow-up - Sequence Diagram
title UC06 - Execute Follow-up - Sequence Diagram

participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "n8n" as N8N
participant "NestJS API" as API
participant "Communication Service" as COMM
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

MQ -> N8N : 1. Deliver followup.started
N8N -> API : 2. Get Enrollment
API -> DB : 3. Query Enrollment
DB --> API : 4. Return Enrollment
N8N -> API : 5. Get Current Step
API -> DB : 6. Query Step
DB --> API : 7. Return Step
N8N -> COMM : 8. Send Email / Message
COMM --> N8N : 9. Return delivery result
N8N -> API : 10. Submit execution result
API -> DB : 11. Save FollowUpExecution
API --> N8N : 12. Return processing result

@enduml
